[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0010","text":"──小糸，我进来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0020","text":"……小糸？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0030","text":"──咿呀……！？\n制、制片人先生……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0040","text":"……没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0050","text":"有、有什么事吗？\n没、没什么问题哦……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0060","text":"……是吗\n那就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0070","text":"你驾驭得很好\n得好好拍几张才行呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0080","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0090","text":"是、是啊……！\n这、这种程度完全没问题的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_02_0100","text":"哈哈，说得对！\n就要这股劲！"}]
